{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 125, "line_no": 2, "text": "打倒上等人再过年，", "bbox_px": {"x": 470, "y": 274, "w": 350, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "打倒上等人再过年，", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 470, "y": 274, "w": 350, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 125, "line_no": 3, "text": "若要我们不造反，", "bbox_px": {"x": 470, "y": 338, "w": 310, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "若要我们不造反，", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 470, "y": 338, "w": 310, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 125, "line_no": 4, "text": "除非免兵又减款。①", "bbox_px": {"x": 470, "y": 398, "w": 338, "h": 53}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "除非免兵又减款。①", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 470, "y": 398, "w": 338, "h": 53}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 125, "line_no": 5, "text": "生活的苦难逼迫人民起来反抗，而给广大人民的生活带来灾难的是清王朝政府。正", "bbox_px": {"x": 225, "y": 463, "w": 1463, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "生活的苦难逼迫人民起来反抗，而给广大人民的生活带来灾难的是清王朝政府。正", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 225, "y": 463, "w": 1463, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 125, "line_no": 6, "text": "是这种反抗思想的日积月累，最终引发了嘉庆年间贵州南笼府（今安龙县）王囊仙领导的", "bbox_px": {"x": 145, "y": 527, "w": 1548, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "是这种反抗思想的日积月累，最终引发了嘉庆年间贵州南笼府（今安龙县）王囊仙领导的", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 145, "y": 527, "w": 1548, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 125, "line_no": 7, "text": "农民大起义。", "bbox_px": {"x": 144, "y": 593, "w": 234, "h": 58}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "农民大起义。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 144, "y": 593, "w": 234, "h": 58}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 125, "line_no": 8, "text": "王囊仙是布依族历史上最伟大的农民起义领袖，也是中国农民起义中少有的女首", "bbox_px": {"x": 229, "y": 660, "w": 1459, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "王囊仙是布依族历史上最伟大的农民起义领袖，也是中国农民起义中少有的女首", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 229, "y": 660, "w": 1459, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 125, "line_no": 9, "text": "领。王囊仙，原名王阿祟，是一位布依族姑娘，生于贵州南笼府洞洒村，起义爆发当年方", "bbox_px": {"x": 145, "y": 724, "w": 1548, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "领。王囊仙，原名王阿祟，是一位布依族姑娘，生于贵州南笼府洞洒村，起义爆发当年方", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 145, "y": 724, "w": 1548, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 125, "line_no": 10, "text": "22 岁。王囊仙平时乐于助人，行善布施，经常以看病为名，联络洞洒村青年男女，深得大", "bbox_px": {"x": 141, "y": 789, "w": 1552, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "22 岁。王囊仙平时乐于助人，行善布施，经常以看病为名，联络洞洒村青年男女，深得大", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 141, "y": 789, "w": 1552, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 125, "line_no": 11, "text": "家的尊敬。王囊仙以行医为名，经过长时间的舆论准备和组织部署，利用巫术和宗教等", "bbox_px": {"x": 145, "y": 853, "w": 1548, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "家的尊敬。王囊仙以行医为名，经过长时间的舆论准备和组织部署，利用巫术和宗教等", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 145, "y": 853, "w": 1548, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 125, "line_no": 12, "text": "方式为手段，广泛动员群众，于嘉庆二年（1797年）正月初五日发动了布依族农民大起", "bbox_px": {"x": 145, "y": 913, "w": 1548, "h": 61}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "方式为手段，广泛动员群众，于嘉庆二年（1797年）正月初五日发动了布依族农民大起", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 145, "y": 913, "w": 1548, "h": 61}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 125, "line_no": 13, "text": "义。王囊仙领导的布依族农民起义，在清政府的重兵镇压下，很快归于失败。但是，在起", "bbox_px": {"x": 149, "y": 982, "w": 1544, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "义。王囊仙领导的布依族农民起义，在清政府的重兵镇压下，很快归于失败。但是，在起", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 149, "y": 982, "w": 1544, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 125, "line_no": 14, "text": "义的高潮时期，王囊仙的队伍曾占领了贵州的大部地区和广西、云南的几个县，并在贵州", "bbox_px": {"x": 144, "y": 1038, "w": 1544, "h": 76}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "义的高潮时期，王囊仙的队伍曾占领了贵州的大部地区和广西、云南的几个县，并在贵州", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 144, "y": 1038, "w": 1544, "h": 76}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 125, "line_no": 15, "text": "建立了临时农民政权。这次起义沉重打击了清王朝在贵州的统治，迫使清政府调整了对", "bbox_px": {"x": 145, "y": 1114, "w": 1548, "h": 53}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "建立了临时农民政权。这次起义沉重打击了清王朝在贵州的统治，迫使清政府调整了对", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 145, "y": 1114, "w": 1548, "h": 53}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 125, "line_no": 16, "text": "贵州民族地区的统治政策。在起义过程中，王囊仙以民歌的形式，借神的口吻，表达了强", "bbox_px": {"x": 149, "y": 1183, "w": 1540, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "贵州民族地区的统治政策。在起义过程中，王囊仙以民歌的形式，借神的口吻，表达了强", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 149, "y": 1183, "w": 1540, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 125, "line_no": 17, "text": "烈的反封建思想。", "bbox_px": {"x": 145, "y": 1243, "w": 314, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "烈的反封建思想。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 145, "y": 1243, "w": 314, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 125, "line_no": 18, "text": "王囊仙对起义队伍说：", "bbox_px": {"x": 229, "y": 1312, "w": 386, "h": 44}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "王囊仙对起义队伍说：", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 229, "y": 1312, "w": 386, "h": 44}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 125, "line_no": 19, "text": "神仙和我讲，", "bbox_px": {"x": 470, "y": 1374, "w": 230, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "神仙和我讲，", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 470, "y": 1374, "w": 230, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 125, "line_no": 20, "text": "要想夺土地，", "bbox_px": {"x": 940, "y": 1374, "w": 230, "h": 55}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "要想夺土地，", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 940, "y": 1374, "w": 230, "h": 55}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 125, "line_no": 21, "text": "要我转告众乡邻。", "bbox_px": {"x": 470, "y": 1440, "w": 314, "h": 49}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "要我转告众乡邻。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 470, "y": 1440, "w": 314, "h": 49}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 125, "line_no": 22, "text": "团结起来打财主。", "bbox_px": {"x": 945, "y": 1440, "w": 310, "h": 49}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "团结起来打财主。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 945, "y": 1440, "w": 310, "h": 49}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 125, "line_no": 23, "text": "我们为何苦？", "bbox_px": {"x": 470, "y": 1505, "w": 229, "h": 44}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "我们为何苦？", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 470, "y": 1505, "w": 229, "h": 44}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 125, "line_no": 24, "text": "要想得太平，", "bbox_px": {"x": 941, "y": 1500, "w": 234, "h": 58}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "要想得太平，", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 941, "y": 1500, "w": 234, "h": 58}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 125, "line_no": 25, "text": "只因有官绅。", "bbox_px": {"x": 474, "y": 1569, "w": 229, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "只因有官绅。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 474, "y": 1569, "w": 229, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 125, "line_no": 26, "text": "捞起刀斧杀上南笼城。", "bbox_px": {"x": 941, "y": 1569, "w": 394, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "捞起刀斧杀上南笼城。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 941, "y": 1569, "w": 394, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 125, "line_no": 27, "text": "神仙还说过，", "bbox_px": {"x": 470, "y": 1637, "w": 229, "h": 49}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "神仙还说过，", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 470, "y": 1637, "w": 229, "h": 49}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 125, "line_no": 28, "text": "把官绅杀尽，", "bbox_px": {"x": 940, "y": 1628, "w": 234, "h": 59}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "把官绅杀尽，", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 940, "y": 1628, "w": 234, "h": 59}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 125, "line_no": 29, "text": "要想得活命。", "bbox_px": {"x": 470, "y": 1700, "w": 234, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "要想得活命。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 470, "y": 1700, "w": 234, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 125, "line_no": 30, "text": "穷人才能得太平。", "bbox_px": {"x": 945, "y": 1702, "w": 310, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "穷人才能得太平。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 945, "y": 1702, "w": 310, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 125, "line_no": 31, "text": "就要扭成一股绳，", "bbox_px": {"x": 470, "y": 1766, "w": 310, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "就要扭成一股绳，", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 470, "y": 1766, "w": 310, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 125, "line_no": 32, "text": "不得官家来压榨，", "bbox_px": {"x": 945, "y": 1766, "w": 306, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "不得官家来压榨，", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 945, "y": 1766, "w": 306, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 125, "line_no": 33, "text": "誓与官绅不两立。", "bbox_px": {"x": 474, "y": 1827, "w": 318, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "誓与官绅不两立。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 474, "y": 1827, "w": 318, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 125, "line_no": 34, "text": "穷人才能得安宁。", "bbox_px": {"x": 945, "y": 1827, "w": 314, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "穷人才能得安宁。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 945, "y": 1827, "w": 314, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 125, "line_no": 35, "text": "要想有饭吃，", "bbox_px": {"x": 470, "y": 1895, "w": 229, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "要想有饭吃，", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 470, "y": 1895, "w": 229, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 125, "line_no": 36, "text": "不得官家逼粮款，", "bbox_px": {"x": 945, "y": 1895, "w": 306, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "不得官家逼粮款，", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 945, "y": 1895, "w": 306, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 125, "line_no": 37, "text": "团结起来反官绅。", "bbox_px": {"x": 478, "y": 1959, "w": 310, "h": 49}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "团结起来反官绅。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 478, "y": 1959, "w": 310, "h": 49}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 125, "line_no": 38, "text": "山寨才清静。", "bbox_px": {"x": 944, "y": 1957, "w": 226, "h": 54}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "山寨才清静。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 944, "y": 1957, "w": 226, "h": 54}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 125, "line_no": 39, "text": "从这首民歌可看出，布依族是一个敢于与封建黑暗势力作顽强斗争的民族。布依族", "bbox_px": {"x": 229, "y": 2024, "w": 1463, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "从这首民歌可看出，布依族是一个敢于与封建黑暗势力作顽强斗争的民族。布依族", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 229, "y": 2024, "w": 1463, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 125, "line_no": 40, "text": "人民通过传颂民歌，表达了冲破封建社会思想禁锢的愿望，体现出百折不挠的反抗精神。", "bbox_px": {"x": 149, "y": 2084, "w": 1552, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "人民通过传颂民歌，表达了冲破封建社会思想禁锢的愿望，体现出百折不挠的反抗精神。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 149, "y": 2084, "w": 1552, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 125, "line_no": 41, "text": "在布依族人民看来，反对封建并非仅仅为了生存、活命，更重要的是为广大的贫苦人民能", "bbox_px": {"x": 149, "y": 2148, "w": 1544, "h": 57}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "在布依族人民看来，反对封建并非仅仅为了生存、活命，更重要的是为广大的贫苦人民能", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 149, "y": 2148, "w": 1544, "h": 57}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 125, "line_no": 42, "text": "够享有永久太平，为了“去找幸福，去找自由”。因此，布依族人民所追求的并非简单的人", "bbox_px": {"x": 148, "y": 2201, "w": 1549, "h": 78}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "够享有永久太平，为了“去找幸福，去找自由”。因此，布依族人民所追求的并非简单的人", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 148, "y": 2201, "w": 1549, "h": 78}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 125, "line_no": 43, "text": "人有田种、个个有饭吃的农业式的社会理想，而是要追求全体人民的自由，追求平静而美", "bbox_px": {"x": 145, "y": 2285, "w": 1548, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "人有田种、个个有饭吃的农业式的社会理想，而是要追求全体人民的自由，追求平静而美", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 145, "y": 2285, "w": 1548, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
